# Raw data - 6.6 GB, far over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# Both partners download these locally; they are never committed.
# NOTE: this excludes directory *contents* rather than the directories themselves,
# because git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
Datasets/*
!Datasets/Primary/
Datasets/Primary/*
!Datasets/Primary/README.md

# macOS cruft
.DS_Store
